            "author": {
              "__typename": "Bot",
              "login": "greptile-apps"
            },
            "body": "<!-- greptile_summary -->\n\n<h2><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/api/retrigger?id=82450366\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/RetriggerDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"Retrigger\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/nvidia-public-github/github/NVIDIA/transformerengine/-/pull/3700\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptileDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"View in Greptile\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a>Confidence Score: 5/5</h2>\n\n**[Medium impact]** The PR appears safe to merge; no blocking issues were found.\n\n<h3>Summary</h3>\n\nRestores forward plan reuse when packed sequence counts fall within the same batch bucket.\n- Packed THD calls in one batch bucket can reuse attention graphs and plans.\n\n<h3>Diagram</h3>\n\n```mermaid\n%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%\nflowchart TD\n  A[Attention configuration] --> B{Bucketed ragged graph?}\n  B -->|Yes| C[Convert lengths and offsets to bucket size]\n  C --> D[Use bucket-sized graph and cached plan]\n  B -->|No| E[Keep existing direct-input eligibility]\n  E --> F[Use existing execution path]\n```\n\n<!-- greptile_confidence_score:5 -->\n\n<sub>Reviews (4) · Last reviewed commit: [\"Merge branch &#39;main&#39; into sudhakars/resto...\"](https://github.com/nvidia/transformerengine/commit/3db839ea3f14728948b01f85a5e9527a9f740879) · [Reviewed by Greptile](https://www.greptile.com/?utm_source=greptile_review&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=review_public&utm_content=nvidia/transformerengine)</sub>",
